                            Maharashtra from 4 th to 5 th September,2023. The State level training was inaugurated by Dr.
                            Pravin Kathane, Joint Director, Mr. R.S Gosaki, Nodal Officer, SPMU , Ms. Madhumanti Roy,
                            Deputy Director and Mr. Shantanu Garg Gender and Training Expert, NPMU – Atal Bhujal
