                            certificate distribution by Mrs. Pavneet Kaur, I.A.S, Commissioner &amp; Project Director, Atal
                            Bhujal Yojana, GSDA Pune, Maharashtra and Mr. Shantanu Garg, Gender &amp; Training Expert.
